Speaking.png is a high-resolution adaptation of the GUIIcons.png sound icon
by RedWolf Design and Jonathan Veit (AniProGuy), with refined speaker
construction. Generated with OpenAI imagegen for Clonk Rust in 2026.

This artwork is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
(CC BY-NC 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Original source: planet/Graphics.c4g/GUIIcons.png, sound icon at (200, 120),
40x40 pixels. See planet/Graphics.c4g/COPYING for the original attribution
and docs/art/speaking-icon.md for the generation and refinement prompts.

StartupOptionIconsHD.png and StartupWipfHD.png are high-resolution adaptations
of RedWolf Design's StartupOptionIcons.png, StartupBookScroll.png, and the
full-body Wipf artwork in Objects.c4d/Animals.c4d/Wipf.c4d/Graphics.png.
Generated with OpenAI imagegen for Clonk Rust in 2026, then prepared with
transparent alpha for the original UI geometry. They use the same CC BY-NC 4.0
license above. See docs/art/startup-icons.md for the sources and modifications.

StartupTabClipHD.png is a high-resolution adaptation of RedWolf Design's
StartupTabClip.png, generated with OpenAI imagegen for Clonk Rust in 2026 and
prepared using the original tab silhouette. It uses the same CC BY-NC 4.0
license above. See docs/art/startup-tab/README.md for the source, selected
prompt, preparation, and in-game comparison.

StartupBookScrollHD.png is a high-resolution adaptation of RedWolf Design's
StartupBookScroll.png. The slider arrow was generated with OpenAI imagegen
for Clonk Rust in 2026. Its mirror and tail cross-section form the other
arrow and the rail in the original atlas layout.
It uses the same CC BY-NC 4.0 license above. See
docs/art/startup-slider/README.md for source artwork, preparation, and the
in-game comparison.

ui-icons/*.png are high-resolution adaptations of GUIIcons.png, GUIIcons2.png
and GUICheckbox.png by RedWolf Design (GUIIcons.png also credits Jonathan Veit,
AniProGuy). Generated with OpenAI imagegen and approved for Clonk Rust in 2026.
The approved complete checkbox artwork combines a smooth flat gray box and
red imagegen checkmark, both adapted from GUICheckbox.png. The approved
256x256 states and separate checkmark are retained in docs/art/ui-checkbox/;
prepare_runtime.py validates and installs them. These adaptations use the same
CC BY-NC 4.0 license above. See docs/art/ui-icons.md,
docs/art/ui-checkbox/full-icon-revision.md, and docs/art/ui-icon-prompts.json
for source coordinates, prompts, and preparation.

hud-icons/*.png are high-resolution adaptations of the nine matching icons in
planet/Graphics.c4g by RedWolf Design. Generated with OpenAI imagegen and
approved for Clonk Rust in 2026, then prepared as transparent sprites at 8x
the source dimensions. They use the same CC BY-NC 4.0 license above. See
docs/art/hud-icons.md for the source and in-game comparison.

menu-icons/*.png are high-resolution adaptations of selected 35x35 cells in
planet/Graphics.c4g/Menu.png and Options.png by RedWolf Design. The approved
previews were generated with OpenAI imagegen for Clonk Rust in 2026 and
prepared as transparent sprites at 8x the source dimensions. The Music, FPS,
and Audio checked variants combine their approved base icons with a red mark
derived from the approved ui-icons/checkbox-on.png artwork. They use the same
CC BY-NC 4.0 license above. See docs/art/menu-icons.md and
docs/art/ui-icon-review-batch3/generation-notes.md for the source cells,
review history, and preparation.

gamepad-icons/*.png are high-resolution adaptations of the four 80x36 phases
in planet/Graphics.c4g/Gamepad.png by RedWolf Design. Generated with OpenAI
imagegen and approved for Clonk Rust in 2026, then prepared as transparent
sprites at 8x the source dimensions. They use the same CC BY-NC 4.0 license
above. See docs/art/ui-icon-review-batch4/generation-notes.md for the source
cells, review history, and preparation.
